# Personal/PII documents — never commit.
# Blanket-ignore PDFs and photos: LES, PCS vouchers and credit reports carry
# SSN, EDIPI, bank routing and dependents' DOBs, and it's far too easy to drop
# a new one in here and commit it by accident. Force-add with `git add -f` if a
# PDF ever genuinely belongs in the repo.
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!frontend/public/**
Financial Account Status.md

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env.local.json
!env.local.json.example

# AWS
.aws-sam/
cdk.out/
samconfig.toml

# Editor/OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
